WEBVTT

00:00:04.000 --> 00:00:10.900
Yugi Muto assembled the Millennium Puzzle 
and became the guardian of the Shadow Games.

00:00:12.400 --> 00:00:17.260
Pegasus has a Millennium Item 
of his own - the Millennium Eye.

00:00:17.260 --> 00:00:21.800
Yugi accepts Pegasus's challenge 
and goes to Duelist Kingdom.

00:00:23.650 --> 00:00:28.010
Pegasus stole his grandfather Sugoroku's 
soul, and Yugi intends to rescue him.

00:00:28.740 --> 00:00:33.850
He battles alongside his trusted 
friends and with his other self.

00:00:39.230 --> 00:00:44.300
I can't finish reading the magazine pages

00:00:46.220 --> 00:00:51.210
I get the feeling that I must read it

00:00:53.100 --> 00:00:57.960
Game cartridges are stacked 
in the corner of the room

00:00:59.920 --> 00:01:04.660
Is there no meaning if I don't play them?

00:01:06.890 --> 00:01:09.760
You're on the other side of the table

00:01:10.210 --> 00:01:13.130
I'm talking to you, but...

00:01:13.730 --> 00:01:20.060
You don't change your 
facial expression at all

00:01:21.000 --> 00:01:26.310
Even though I'm this close to you

00:01:26.810 --> 00:01:33.580
These feelings don't reach 
you, don't reach you

00:01:34.000 --> 00:01:40.320
What is truly precious?

00:01:47.520 --> 00:01:49.200
What?

00:01:53.800 --> 00:01:55.460
What's with them?

00:01:56.430 --> 00:02:01.200
Call of the Haunted turned all 
the monsters into Zombies.

00:02:04.210 --> 00:02:05.400
What?

00:02:05.400 --> 00:02:08.470
Go!  Dragon Zombie attacks!

00:02:08.660 --> 00:02:11.330
Zombie Deadly Breath!

00:02:16.410 --> 00:02:20.000
They're too dangerous!

00:02:20.290 --> 00:02:26.290
Shield & Sword

00:02:35.510 --> 00:02:42.060
How's that?  Call of the Haunted resurrected 
all the monsters you destroyed as Zombies.

00:02:42.060 --> 00:02:46.080
Since my Zombies are immortal, 
there's no way you can win.

00:02:47.170 --> 00:02:49.880
Hey, it's your turn.

00:02:49.880 --> 00:02:52.060
Damn!

00:02:52.060 --> 00:02:54.600
Go, Garoozis!

00:02:54.600 --> 00:02:56.460
Take down his Zombie!

00:03:00.030 --> 00:03:02.360
Five Slash Instant Death!

00:03:02.530 --> 00:03:03.450
That was pointless.

00:03:03.450 --> 00:03:03.900
What?

00:03:03.900 --> 00:03:10.000
I told you that Call of the 
Haunted is on the field.

00:03:13.360 --> 00:03:15.040
It reformed.

00:03:15.260 --> 00:03:17.330
That's not all.

00:03:17.330 --> 00:03:23.850
Every time a Zombie is destroyed and 
resurrected, it gains 10% of its original attack points.

00:03:23.850 --> 00:03:24.420
What?

00:03:24.660 --> 00:03:28.540
Crass Clown had 1350 attack points.

00:03:28.540 --> 00:03:34.460
Since it's now a Zombie, the Field Power Source 
gives it a 30% bonus, so it has 1755 attack points.

00:03:34.620 --> 00:03:39.060
And since it resurrected, it gains 
another 10% for a total of 1890.

00:03:39.250 --> 00:03:43.930
It has more than Garoozis's 
1800 attack points!

00:03:43.930 --> 00:03:44.800
Oh no!

00:03:44.800 --> 00:03:48.710
Clown Zombie attacks with Hell Acrobatics!

00:03:59.400 --> 00:04:01.330
Are we all here?

00:04:01.330 --> 00:04:02.000
Yeah.

00:04:02.000 --> 00:04:03.600
Huh?  Where's Bakura?

00:04:04.320 --> 00:04:06.330
We got separated.

00:04:06.330 --> 00:04:08.060
What should we do, Yugi?

00:04:08.060 --> 00:04:09.000
This isn't good.

00:04:09.000 --> 00:04:10.860
Hey!

00:04:10.860 --> 00:04:12.130
That voice!

00:04:12.130 --> 00:04:13.260
It's Bakura!

00:04:13.260 --> 00:04:14.430
This way, Bakura!

00:04:14.600 --> 00:04:16.600
Hey!

00:04:16.600 --> 00:04:17.940
Wait for me!

00:04:21.000 --> 00:04:23.860
I said wait!

00:04:25.830 --> 00:04:28.930
Don't bring creepy things with you!

00:04:28.930 --> 00:04:31.150
I can't move another inch.

00:04:31.330 --> 00:04:35.000
On the bright side, we made good progress.

00:04:35.000 --> 00:04:36.050
Sorry.

00:04:36.050 --> 00:04:38.930
Yugi, which way should we go?

00:04:44.130 --> 00:04:47.450
This place is getting creepier and creepier.

00:04:47.450 --> 00:04:52.370
Jonouchi can't handle this occult stuff.

00:04:52.530 --> 00:04:55.470
We have to find Jonouchi 
as quickly as possible.

00:04:55.710 --> 00:04:56.440
Yeah!

00:04:57.600 --> 00:04:59.000
What?

00:05:01.740 --> 00:05:03.110
What's that sound?

00:05:03.110 --> 00:05:04.930
Sorry.  I think it's my fault-

00:05:04.930 --> 00:05:05.650
Shh!

00:05:08.330 --> 00:05:10.020
It's getting louder.

00:05:10.200 --> 00:05:11.930
I have a bad feeling about this.

00:05:11.930 --> 00:05:13.930
What is that sound?

00:05:20.270 --> 00:05:22.730
Why is it coming toward us?

00:05:22.730 --> 00:05:23.740
Don't ask me!

00:05:23.740 --> 00:05:27.000
I'm sorry! I'm sorry! I'm sorry!

00:05:37.750 --> 00:05:39.260
Bakura!

00:05:40.220 --> 00:05:41.530
Bakura!

00:05:42.600 --> 00:05:45.200
What?  It's a dead end!

00:05:48.430 --> 00:05:50.800
Damn!

00:05:50.800 --> 00:05:51.960
Don't be crazy, Honda!

00:05:51.960 --> 00:05:53.170
Honda!

00:06:00.700 --> 00:06:01.860
It's a balloon?

00:06:03.180 --> 00:06:04.530
And a speaker.

00:06:04.870 --> 00:06:08.460
That made it sound like a real boulder.

00:06:09.730 --> 00:06:11.930
Are you okay, Bakura?

00:06:11.930 --> 00:06:15.130
We're being teased.

00:06:15.130 --> 00:06:17.400
Pegasus, I'll make you pay!

00:06:21.330 --> 00:06:26.200
Even if I destroy them, these immortal 
Zombie monsters resurrect with more attack points.

00:06:26.200 --> 00:06:28.730
How can I defeat them?

00:06:30.240 --> 00:06:33.970
No matter how hard you think, 
there's no way you can win.

00:06:34.140 --> 00:06:36.650
The boss's strategy is perfect.

00:06:36.650 --> 00:06:39.000
Just give up.

00:06:40.180 --> 00:06:43.480
If I lose these Star Chips, it's all over.

00:06:44.600 --> 00:06:46.330
You loser dog!

00:06:50.410 --> 00:06:53.260
I'm not a loser dog!

00:06:53.260 --> 00:06:55.930
For Shizuka's sake, I can't lose.

00:06:55.930 --> 00:06:59.630
I'll win by believing in myself 
and betting on this card!

00:07:01.260 --> 00:07:03.000
Time Wizard.

00:07:03.510 --> 00:07:08.460
This card miraculously 
helped me win many times.

00:07:13.050 --> 00:07:17.330
Time Wizard's Time Magic may be able 
to defeat those immortal Zombies.

00:07:18.250 --> 00:07:19.600
It's all or nothing.

00:07:19.600 --> 00:07:20.530
Here I go!

00:07:20.530 --> 00:07:22.060
Time Wizard!

00:07:25.310 --> 00:07:27.330
Time Wizard?

00:07:27.570 --> 00:07:32.830
This is bad.  If Time Magic succeeds, 
it may destroy all the Zombies.

00:07:33.010 --> 00:07:34.730
Time Roulette!

00:07:37.700 --> 00:07:38.930
Boss!

00:07:38.930 --> 00:07:40.000
Don't be scared.

00:07:40.000 --> 00:07:43.330
Time Roulette has a 50% chance of working.

00:07:43.330 --> 00:07:45.200
It all depends on luck.

00:07:45.200 --> 00:07:48.150
Let's hope your luck holds out.

00:07:50.950 --> 00:07:53.330
I'm counting on you, Time Wizard.

00:07:53.330 --> 00:07:55.530
Please miss the mark!

00:07:58.720 --> 00:08:00.200
The arrow is stopping.

00:08:11.350 --> 00:08:12.330
What?

00:08:12.330 --> 00:08:13.800
It missed!

00:08:15.520 --> 00:08:18.310
When Time Magic fails, it 
leads to self-destruction.

00:08:18.310 --> 00:08:23.350
A time vortex swallows up Time 
Wizard and Flame Swordsman.

00:08:23.600 --> 00:08:24.620
Wait!

00:08:27.850 --> 00:08:29.220
That's not all.

00:08:29.570 --> 00:08:34.230
You lose life points equal to half your 
destroyed monsters' attack points.

00:08:35.330 --> 00:08:38.660
Awesome!  He hurt himself!

00:08:38.660 --> 00:08:42.470
I didn't know I'd take this much 
damage if Time Roulette failed.

00:08:42.660 --> 00:08:47.740
Play another monster that will 
fall victim to my Zombies!

00:08:49.060 --> 00:08:51.640
Isn't there anything I can do?

00:08:51.640 --> 00:08:53.000
Defense position.

00:08:53.000 --> 00:08:54.400
Go, Dragon Zomb-

00:08:54.400 --> 00:08:55.210
Wait.

00:08:56.070 --> 00:09:00.220
Even if you destroy that weakling, 
he won't lose any life points.

00:09:00.220 --> 00:09:03.720
Strengthen your Zombie squad instead.

00:09:03.930 --> 00:09:06.130
Play your King of Ghosts!

00:09:06.130 --> 00:09:07.580
Understood.

00:09:07.580 --> 00:09:09.930
Come out, Pumpking!

00:09:14.730 --> 00:09:15.850
What is that?

00:09:15.850 --> 00:09:18.300
Pumpking the King of Ghosts!

00:09:18.300 --> 00:09:20.850
And the field powers it up!

00:09:20.850 --> 00:09:21.940
King of Ghosts?

00:09:22.130 --> 00:09:25.080
Pumpking has a special effect.

00:09:25.610 --> 00:09:27.860
Ectoplasm Fortification!

00:09:30.930 --> 00:09:32.960
What's happening?

00:09:32.960 --> 00:09:40.730
Pumpking provides my ghost monsters with 
ectoplasm, the source of their power.

00:09:40.730 --> 00:09:45.460
Their attack points will 
increase by 10% every turn.

00:09:45.460 --> 00:09:46.130
What?

00:09:46.130 --> 00:09:50.870
As my Zombies gain attack 
points, they also grow larger.

00:09:51.030 --> 00:09:53.210
Go, Dragon Zombie!

00:09:53.210 --> 00:09:55.650
Zombie Deadly Breath!

00:09:58.410 --> 00:10:00.860
Your monster was Kojikocy?

00:10:00.860 --> 00:10:03.420
That card never stood a chance.

00:10:03.660 --> 00:10:04.850
Damn!

00:10:04.850 --> 00:10:06.660
I play my next card in defense position.

00:10:06.660 --> 00:10:10.790
Ectoplasm Fortification!  
My Zombie squad powers up!

00:10:10.790 --> 00:10:13.530
Zombie Deadly Breath!

00:10:15.750 --> 00:10:17.530
Not my Armored Lizard too!

00:10:17.530 --> 00:10:21.930
Awesome!  Boss, your combo is perfect!

00:10:21.930 --> 00:10:23.050
Not so fast.

00:10:23.050 --> 00:10:27.870
If you draw a certain card from your 
deck, you'll form an unbeatable combo.

00:10:27.870 --> 00:10:29.780
I can only defend.

00:10:29.780 --> 00:10:32.260
Zombie Deadly Breath!

00:10:35.570 --> 00:10:38.400
This is great!

00:10:39.020 --> 00:10:40.950
If nothing changes, I'll lose!

00:10:53.900 --> 00:10:56.400
Zombie Deadly Breath!

00:11:00.960 --> 00:11:02.810
They become stronger every turn.

00:11:03.060 --> 00:11:05.310
My Zombie squad is invincible!

00:11:05.310 --> 00:11:08.310
Your ghost combo is perfect, boss!

00:11:08.310 --> 00:11:12.200
Bring out your next monster 
that I'll destroy!

00:11:13.040 --> 00:11:15.200
Is there no way I can win?

00:11:15.200 --> 00:11:17.190
Jonouchi!

00:11:19.560 --> 00:11:21.730
Yugi!  Everyone!

00:11:22.980 --> 00:11:23.800
Hey!

00:11:24.800 --> 00:11:27.250
Why is there a Duel Ring here?

00:11:27.250 --> 00:11:31.060
Jonouchi, why are you dueling here?

00:11:31.060 --> 00:11:32.650
It wasn't my choice.

00:11:32.650 --> 00:11:36.480
Those cheaters dragged 
me here against my will!

00:11:36.480 --> 00:11:37.600
What?

00:11:39.070 --> 00:11:40.450
Who are you?

00:11:40.450 --> 00:11:42.600
We won't let you interrupt this duel.

00:11:42.600 --> 00:11:43.580
What?

00:11:43.580 --> 00:11:46.090
You'll have to use force to get past us.

00:11:46.330 --> 00:11:47.590
Fine!

00:11:47.770 --> 00:11:49.490
Here I go!

00:11:53.650 --> 00:11:54.990
Honda!

00:11:54.990 --> 00:11:56.600
Honda!  Dammit!

00:11:56.600 --> 00:11:58.050
Hold it!

00:11:58.050 --> 00:12:03.100
If you leave the Duel Ring, that means 
you forfeit, and I get your Star Chips.

00:12:03.100 --> 00:12:03.840
What?

00:12:03.840 --> 00:12:05.860
This duel is illegal!

00:12:05.860 --> 00:12:06.570
That's right!

00:12:06.740 --> 00:12:12.260
Quiet!  He agreed to this 
duel with those stipulations.

00:12:12.260 --> 00:12:14.050
Keep going, Jonouchi.

00:12:14.410 --> 00:12:16.840
Don't lose to these punks.

00:12:16.840 --> 00:12:19.590
There's someone you need to protect.

00:12:24.200 --> 00:12:27.330
Don't drop something so important to you.

00:12:27.330 --> 00:12:28.330
Honda...

00:12:28.330 --> 00:12:30.830
Are you continuing or giving up?

00:12:31.060 --> 00:12:35.330
I don't care either way as 
long as I get your Star Chips.

00:12:35.330 --> 00:12:38.100
You've been talking this whole time!

00:12:38.100 --> 00:12:40.340
Who are you?

00:12:40.340 --> 00:12:43.730
Me?  I'm Bandit Keith.

00:12:43.730 --> 00:12:45.200
Bandit Keith?

00:12:45.200 --> 00:12:47.330
I've heard that name before.

00:12:47.330 --> 00:12:48.930
From Kaiba.

00:12:48.930 --> 00:12:51.130
He's a bounty hunter who challenged Pegasus.

00:12:51.130 --> 00:12:55.800
He was an undefeated pro card 
player until Pegasus defeated him.

00:12:57.030 --> 00:13:00.930
And he's backing my opponent in this duel?

00:13:01.110 --> 00:13:04.460
You just have bad luck.

00:13:04.460 --> 00:13:07.430
I already gave him my perfect strategy.

00:13:07.790 --> 00:13:10.930
There's no way you can win.

00:13:10.930 --> 00:13:14.940
The four of us are going to Pegasus's castle.

00:13:15.130 --> 00:13:17.260
This is your graveyard.

00:13:17.260 --> 00:13:21.250
A Graveyard Field crawling with Zombies!

00:13:21.250 --> 00:13:22.680
Graveyard Field?

00:13:22.680 --> 00:13:26.060
Play your next card.

00:13:27.140 --> 00:13:28.530
Shizuka...

00:13:28.950 --> 00:13:30.730
Dammit!

00:13:30.730 --> 00:13:32.130
I won't lose!

00:13:32.690 --> 00:13:35.860
You talk a big game, but you're pathetic.

00:13:35.860 --> 00:13:37.130
Say whatever you want.

00:13:37.130 --> 00:13:39.870
I'll keep defending until I find 
an opening for a counterattack.

00:13:39.870 --> 00:13:42.600
But how long can you survive?

00:13:42.600 --> 00:13:43.400
What?

00:13:43.690 --> 00:13:48.660
There's a card in his deck that will 
create an even more powerful combo.

00:13:48.660 --> 00:13:50.840
Once he draws it, you're finished.

00:13:51.040 --> 00:13:54.350
The ghost combo will become stronger?

00:13:54.350 --> 00:13:55.350
Here I go!

00:13:56.350 --> 00:13:59.120
I did it, boss!  It's Stop Defense!

00:13:59.330 --> 00:14:00.530
Stop Defense?

00:14:01.040 --> 00:14:03.090
Oh no!  If he plays that...

00:14:03.330 --> 00:14:07.930
You'll no longer be able to 
defend starting next turn.

00:14:09.330 --> 00:14:13.930
Ectoplasm Fortification!  My 
Zombie squad gains attack points!

00:14:13.930 --> 00:14:16.530
Go, my invincible Dragon Zombie!

00:14:16.530 --> 00:14:19.840
Destroy that coward's defense monster!

00:14:19.840 --> 00:14:22.200
Zombie Deadly Breath!

00:14:23.400 --> 00:14:25.260
It's over, punk.

00:14:25.260 --> 00:14:27.460
You've got nowhere to run.

00:14:30.020 --> 00:14:32.330
Don't give up, Jonouchi!

00:14:32.330 --> 00:14:33.020
Hang in there!

00:14:33.260 --> 00:14:35.200
I won't forgive you if you lose!

00:14:35.200 --> 00:14:36.520
I know!

00:14:36.940 --> 00:14:40.030
I won't give up until the very end!

00:14:40.960 --> 00:14:42.280
Here I go!

00:14:42.280 --> 00:14:45.260
Come out, Red-Eyes B. Dragon!

00:14:52.660 --> 00:14:55.910
What?  He has a rare card?

00:14:55.910 --> 00:14:59.440
If I can't defend, then I'll just attack!

00:14:59.440 --> 00:15:02.650
Red-Eyes, squash that squash!

00:15:02.650 --> 00:15:05.920
This is bad.  It has more 
attack points than mine.

00:15:06.270 --> 00:15:07.730
Black Fireball!

00:15:11.350 --> 00:15:12.460
He did it!

00:15:12.460 --> 00:15:16.260
Good!  Now his Zombie monsters 
won't gain attack points!

00:15:17.120 --> 00:15:19.800
Pumpking was a ghost monster from the start.

00:15:19.800 --> 00:15:22.660
I can't use Call of the 
Haunted to resurrect it.

00:15:22.660 --> 00:15:24.530
Don't get flustered, Kotsuzuka.

00:15:25.080 --> 00:15:28.930
Your Zombie squad is sufficiently powered up.

00:15:28.930 --> 00:15:30.600
You're right.

00:15:30.600 --> 00:15:32.400
Zombie Deadly Breath!

00:15:32.400 --> 00:15:34.280
Waste away, Red-Eyes!

00:15:34.650 --> 00:15:35.930
Red-Eyes!

00:15:38.850 --> 00:15:41.520
Even Red-Eyes is no match for me.

00:15:41.710 --> 00:15:44.760
Red-Eyes was my most powerful card.

00:15:45.750 --> 00:15:47.860
You're done, punk.

00:15:48.230 --> 00:15:49.500
Jonouchi...

00:15:49.670 --> 00:15:50.800
What can I do?

00:15:50.800 --> 00:15:52.460
I have three cards in my hand.

00:15:52.460 --> 00:15:57.740
My only monster card is Battle Warrior, 
but it doesn't have enough attack points.

00:15:57.740 --> 00:16:01.130
Draw your card so that I can finish you.

00:16:01.130 --> 00:16:04.660
Yugi, isn't there any way Jonouchi can win?

00:16:04.660 --> 00:16:06.380
That's easier said than done.

00:16:06.380 --> 00:16:09.480
Attacking the Zombies won't have any effect.

00:16:09.480 --> 00:16:12.260
And he can't defend due to that trap card.

00:16:12.660 --> 00:16:15.130
Defend...  Oh yeah!

00:16:15.130 --> 00:16:16.860
There is a way, Jonouchi!

00:16:16.860 --> 00:16:20.490
Your deck contains a card 
that can turn this around!

00:16:21.130 --> 00:16:21.730
What?

00:16:22.730 --> 00:16:24.230
How interesting.

00:16:24.410 --> 00:16:26.260
You're Yugi, right?

00:16:26.260 --> 00:16:30.600
You may have beaten Kaiba, 
but my combo is perfect.

00:16:30.600 --> 00:16:32.460
There's no way to make a comeback.

00:16:32.460 --> 00:16:33.710
Jonouchi.

00:16:34.660 --> 00:16:35.440
Yugi.

00:16:38.730 --> 00:16:39.680
I understand.

00:16:39.950 --> 00:16:41.350
I believe you!

00:16:42.640 --> 00:16:44.460
This is...

00:16:44.460 --> 00:16:47.190
Shield & Sword.

00:16:47.750 --> 00:16:52.600
This spell card swaps the attack and defense 
points of every monster on the field.

00:16:52.890 --> 00:16:54.190
I see!

00:16:54.190 --> 00:16:58.660
If I swap the Zombies' overwhelming attack 
points with their defense points...

00:16:59.530 --> 00:17:00.970
I have to try.

00:17:01.130 --> 00:17:04.400
I play Battle Warrior in attack position.

00:17:06.130 --> 00:17:08.400
So that's you final victim.

00:17:08.400 --> 00:17:09.480
Next...

00:17:09.700 --> 00:17:12.600
This spell card swaps 
attack and defense points!

00:17:12.600 --> 00:17:13.600
What?

00:17:13.600 --> 00:17:15.050
Go!

00:17:22.030 --> 00:17:23.140
Oh no.

00:17:23.140 --> 00:17:27.930
Zombie Monsters have no free 
will, so they don't defend.

00:17:29.770 --> 00:17:32.800
The Zombies have 0 attack points!

00:17:32.800 --> 00:17:36.140
Battle Warrior also swaps its 
attack and defense points.

00:17:36.330 --> 00:17:38.060
Here I go, you zombie freak!

00:17:38.500 --> 00:17:41.000
Ultimate Screw Knuckle!

00:17:43.540 --> 00:17:47.110
Since the Zombies have 0 attack 
points, they can't resurrect.

00:17:47.110 --> 00:17:49.380
I lose.

00:17:49.610 --> 00:17:50.820
All right!

00:17:51.060 --> 00:17:53.250
Jonouchi!

00:17:53.490 --> 00:17:55.490
I did it, Yugi.

00:17:57.990 --> 00:17:59.660
Let's go.

00:17:59.660 --> 00:18:00.800
Boss...

00:18:02.700 --> 00:18:03.930
Boss!

00:18:03.930 --> 00:18:05.360
Bandit Keith!

00:18:05.660 --> 00:18:11.200
If you really are a duelist, then 
battle fair and square next time.

00:18:11.730 --> 00:18:13.730
Fair and square?

00:18:13.730 --> 00:18:15.400
Don't make me laugh.

00:18:15.400 --> 00:18:19.710
Tricking your opponent is what 
card games are all about.

00:18:19.710 --> 00:18:24.130
Winning is the only thing that 
matters, no matter what it takes.

00:18:24.130 --> 00:18:27.060
I promise to defeat you, Keith!

00:18:27.980 --> 00:18:31.530
You don't have the skills.

00:18:35.250 --> 00:18:36.800
He's the worst!

00:18:36.800 --> 00:18:37.960
Yugi!

00:18:38.330 --> 00:18:41.600
I'm sorry that I made you worry.

00:18:41.600 --> 00:18:44.860
You should be!  Bakura almost died!

00:18:44.860 --> 00:18:47.970
It's okay.  It wasn't Jonouchi's fault.

00:18:47.970 --> 00:18:51.480
Since you defeated them, 
I guess I'll forgive you.

00:18:51.730 --> 00:18:54.000
Yeah!  You did really well, Jonouchi!

00:18:54.000 --> 00:18:56.020
You were great, Jonouchi.

00:18:56.020 --> 00:18:57.650
It was pure luck.

00:18:57.650 --> 00:18:59.220
It wasn't luck.

00:18:59.780 --> 00:19:06.330
You won because of your tenacity 
and what you were fighting for.

00:19:08.620 --> 00:19:10.730
I only need two more Star Chips.

00:19:10.890 --> 00:19:12.970
Hang in there, Shizuka.

00:19:13.150 --> 00:19:15.530
Let's get out of this creepy place.

00:19:15.530 --> 00:19:16.400
Yeah.

00:19:22.660 --> 00:19:23.830
It's the exit.

00:19:29.290 --> 00:19:30.460
What?

00:19:34.680 --> 00:19:38.460
Now they'll never get out of the cave!

00:19:40.630 --> 00:19:42.630
Good work.

00:19:43.430 --> 00:19:45.130
Isn't this going too far?

00:19:47.320 --> 00:19:48.400
Satake!

00:19:49.360 --> 00:19:50.460
Boss?

00:19:51.330 --> 00:19:53.660
How dare you lose to that punk!

00:19:53.660 --> 00:19:56.480
But I only did what you told me to do!

00:19:56.730 --> 00:19:58.130
Shut up!

00:20:01.870 --> 00:20:03.830
I now have exactly ten Chips.

00:20:03.830 --> 00:20:08.850
This wasn't what I planned, but I 
alone can get into Pegasus's castle.

00:20:09.300 --> 00:20:13.060
Just wait, Pegasus.  I'll defeat you!

00:20:16.060 --> 00:20:19.260
Damn!  It won't budge!

00:20:19.260 --> 00:20:21.130
We're trapped!

00:20:21.130 --> 00:20:23.330
What will happen to us?

00:20:23.330 --> 00:20:28.330
Damn!  Let us out, Keith!

00:20:32.130 --> 00:20:36.860
Since we're trapped, we search 
the cave for another exit.

00:20:36.860 --> 00:20:40.320
The Player Killers known as the 
Labyrinth Brothers show up!

00:20:40.320 --> 00:20:45.730
We'll never reach the surface again if we don't 
beat them in a tag duel and find the correct exit!

00:20:45.730 --> 00:20:48.860
Since you look alike, 
stop trying to trick us!

00:20:48.860 --> 00:20:51.330
Do your best, Yugi and Jonouchi!

00:20:51.330 --> 00:20:54.330
I know you can win by working together!

00:20:54.330 --> 00:20:57.130
Next time on Yu-Gi-Oh!:
Labyrinth Tag Duel

00:20:57.130 --> 00:20:58.860
Duel, standby!

00:21:02.060 --> 00:21:10.460
The flask glistens

00:21:11.500 --> 00:21:18.310
Wait for me in the science classroom

00:21:18.800 --> 00:21:27.280
If we put our cold hands together

00:21:27.980 --> 00:21:35.060
And rub them together, they become warm

00:21:36.760 --> 00:21:40.890
Shower of happiness

00:21:41.180 --> 00:21:45.000
I will shower you with it

00:21:45.330 --> 00:21:53.280
I will support you even when you feel lonely

00:21:53.480 --> 00:21:57.510
Shower of happiness

00:21:57.780 --> 00:22:01.640
You are not alone

00:22:02.020 --> 00:22:08.360
You're protected by a 
giant ring of friendship
